==================================================
FEE ESCROW
==================================================

The current repository configuration includes a Pons v2 fee escrow.

ROB can query:

native escrow balance for a recipient

and where applicable:

token-denominated escrow balance for a recipient and quote token.

These queries help distinguish:

PROTOCOL ACTIVITY

from

CREATOR-RELATED ACCRUAL

from

ACTUAL TREASURY RECEIPT.

==================================================
ESCROW ≠ TREASURY RECEIPT
==================================================

This distinction is mandatory.

An escrow balance may indicate:

funds attributable to a recipient inside protocol infrastructure.

It does not automatically mean:

the external treasury wallet possesses those assets.

Therefore use:

ESCROW BALANCE

when the funds remain in escrow.

Use:

TREASURY RECEIPT

only after wallet-level evidence establishes receipt.

